{"kind":"request","text":"Head stream fallback on the page. Child of request e6a5cd22, item 1:\non celld 0.6.3 `/v1/scopes/\u003cscope\u003e/stream` answers 200 and ends at once\n(\"RPC streams cannot cross isolate boundaries yet\"), so the room page\nshows no live updates. After H3-mac. No kernel change.\n\nDecision: dap waits for celld for the stream itself; the celld matter is\nnamed for Hugh and is not dap work. The page gets a fallback.\n\n1. packages/client/src/head-stream.ts treats a stream that closes with\n   no event as unavailable, and the subscriber receives one `fallback`\n   signal with the reason. Reconnects use backoff from 1 s to 30 s.\n2. While the stream is unavailable the page re-reads the summary head\n   at a bounded interval (a member of the page's settings, default\n   5 s) and renders changes as it does for a stream event. When the\n   stream delivers again the re-reads stop. A second participant sees\n   a new comment without a reload.\n3. The page shows that it is polling, in one short line, so a person\n   knows live updates are degraded.\n4. Witnesses: (a) a stream that closes at once leads to the fallback\n   and a later entry appears on the page within two intervals; (b) a\n   working stream never starts the re-reads; (c) on the Mac mini behind\n   Caddy a second browser sees a new comment without a reload.\n\nConditions: one head on main; gate once at the sent head; implementation\nnote and manifest per docs/testing.md and ruling 4e199bd8; exact-head\nchecker review; the Workers are unchanged in behaviour when the stream\nworks (witness b).","body":{"conditions":"One head on main after H3-mac; gate once at the sent head; note and manifest per docs/testing.md and ruling 4e199bd8; exact-head checker review; witnesses (a)-(c); no kernel change.","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:02fbe468d3e4230c01fd0a5420fe6b8d19bca7b4 stale; retired bases: git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:46f9d0f1944ead2f3d94c4be1267c73a4bdec1a1","target_head":"41da9810f0c2d8727b07c129b2d47149107993e7","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}